<BillBody>
<BillTitle>AN ACT Relating to repealing an unconstitutional ban on contracting with private prisons in the state of Washington pursuant to the 9th circuit ruling in The Geo Group v. Newsom; and repealing RCW 70.395.010, 70.395.020, 70.395.030, 70.395.900, and 70.395.901.</BillTitle>
<EnactedClause />
<BillSection type="new" action="repeal">
<BillSectionHeader><BillSectionNumber><TextRun>Sec. </TextRun><Value>1</Value><TextRun>.  </TextRun></BillSectionNumber><P>The following acts or parts of acts are each repealed:</P></BillSectionHeader>
<P><RepealNumber>1</RepealNumber><SectionCite><TextRun>RCW </TextRun><TitleNumber>70</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>395</ChapterNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><SectionNumber>010</SectionNumber></SectionCite> (Findings<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>Intent) and 2021 c 30 s 1;</P>
<P><RepealNumber>2</RepealNumber><SectionCite><TextRun>RCW </TextRun><TitleNumber>70</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>395</ChapterNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><SectionNumber>020</SectionNumber></SectionCite> (Definitions) and 2021 c 30 s 2;</P>
<P><RepealNumber>3</RepealNumber><SectionCite><TextRun>RCW </TextRun><TitleNumber>70</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>395</ChapterNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><SectionNumber>030</SectionNumber></SectionCite> (Prohibition on private incarceration) and 2021 c 30 s 3;</P>
<P><RepealNumber>4</RepealNumber><SectionCite><TextRun>RCW </TextRun><TitleNumber>70</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>395</ChapterNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><SectionNumber>900</SectionNumber></SectionCite> (Construction<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>2021 c 30) and 2021 c 30 s 4; and</P>
<P><RepealNumber>5</RepealNumber><SectionCite><TextRun>RCW </TextRun><TitleNumber>70</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>395</ChapterNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><SectionNumber>901</SectionNumber></SectionCite> (Effective date<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>2021 c 30) and 2021 c 30 s 5.</P>
</BillSection>
</BillBody>
</Bill>